lative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-teal-500\"></span></span>IA conversacional para clínicas odontológicas</div></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div><h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight\">Automação inteligente para<!-- --> <span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-400 to-teal-200\">clínicas odontológicas</span></h1><p class=\"text-xl text-white/60 mb-8\">Atenda pacientes 24/7 via WhatsApp e Instagram, reduza no-shows em até 30% e aumente sua receita com IA conversacional.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-teal-800 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition shadow-lg shadow-teal-800/30\" href=\"/dashboard\">Acessar Dashboard<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-slot=\"icon\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition border border-white/10\" href=\"/api/docs\">Ver Documentação</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 mt-10 pt-10 border-t border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-slot=\"icon\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-teal-400\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Setup em 5 minutos</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-slot=\"icon\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-teal-400\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Sem cartão de crédito</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-slot=\"icon\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-teal-400\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Suporte 24/7</span></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10 hover:border-teal-500/30 transition\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-teal-200 mb-2\">80%</div><div class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Taxa de automação</div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10 hover:border-teal-500/30 transition\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-teal-200 mb-2\">&lt;5s</div><div class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Tempo de resposta</div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10 hover:border-teal-500/30 transition\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-teal-200 mb-2\">30%</div><div class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Redução no-shows</div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10 hover:border-teal-500/30 transition\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-teal-200 mb-2\">24/7</div><div class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Atendimento</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-20\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-4\">Funcionalidades Principais</h2><p class=\"text-white/60 text-center mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Tudo o que você precisa para automatizar sua clínica e proporcionar uma experiência excepcional aos seus pacientes.</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white/5 backdr